{"id":"580cc04d629fcdb8","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md","title":"Handle Decomposition","display":"df-handle-decomposition — Handle Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-handle-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-handle-decomposition"],"display":"df-handle-decomposition — Handle Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-handle-attaching.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-handle-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-handle-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-handle-decomposition — Handle Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e118f18d4da6f655\" href=\"?note=e118f18d4da6f655\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-handle-attaching.md\">../batch12/58-df-handle-attaching.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,n,c\\in V\">\\(M,n,c\\in V\\)</span>；第三个参数仍为各指标的把手数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(c_k)_{k\\le n}\">\\(c=(c_k)_{k\\le n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_j=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(j)\">\\(D_j=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_j=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(j)\">\\(B_j=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(j)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>，参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\">\\((N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\\)</span>；几何附着条件由依赖文件给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(H,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)+1\\},\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Phi,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)\\right)\n\\land H(\\langle0,0\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n(k&gt;0\\to H(\\langle k,0\\rangle)=H(\\langle k-1,c(k-1)\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in c(k)\\;\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\!\\left(\nH(\\langle k,i+1\\rangle),H(\\langle k,i\\rangle),\nD_k\\times D_{n-k},\\Phi(\\langle k,i\\rangle),k,n\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\land M=H(\\langle n,c(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(H,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)+1\\},\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Phi,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)\\right)\n\\land H(\\langle0,0\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n(k&gt;0\\to H(\\langle k,0\\rangle)=H(\\langle k-1,c(k-1)\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in c(k)\\;\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\!\\left(\nH(\\langle k,i+1\\rangle),H(\\langle k,i\\rangle),\nD_k\\times D_{n-k},\\Phi(\\langle k,i\\rangle),k,n\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\land M=H(\\langle n,c(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仍定义按指标排序、每个指标只有有限多个把手的原有三元关系，不把它扩张为任意无限把手分解。</li>\n<li>所有中间阶段由同一函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(k)=0\">\\(c(k)=0\\)</span> 时该阶段不执行附着。</li>\n<li>把手的光滑边界、领圈和磨平商空间等几何条件仍由原有把手附着依赖负责。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-handle-attaching.md","status":"resolved","id":"e118f18d4da6f655","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-handle-attaching.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,n,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"c=(c_k)_{k\\le n}","display":false},{"tex":"D_j=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(j)","display":false},{"tex":"B_j=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(j)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists H,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(H,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)+1\\},\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Phi,\\{\\langle k,i\\rangle:k\\in n+1\\land i\\in c(k)\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)\\right)\n\\land H(\\langle0,0\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n(k>0\\to H(\\langle k,0\\rangle)=H(\\langle k-1,c(k-1)\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in c(k)\\;\\mathrm{HandleAttachment}_S\\!\\left(\nH(\\langle k,i+1\\rangle),H(\\langle k,i\\rangle),\nD_k\\times D_{n-k},\\Phi(\\langle k,i\\rangle),k,n\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\land M=H(\\langle n,c(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"c(k)=0","display":false}],"bytes":1964,"backlinks":[{"id":"157244bd3dfd5b5d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S$ (handle-decomposition predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-603","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md|58-df-handle-decomposition]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["e118f18d4da6f655","36d7463d215be751","ca7fc3ab38a11801"]}